WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.200
One fine morning, your distant Aunt Carol
came to your family home in an almost frantic

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.759
state of excitement.

00:00:06.759 --> 00:00:11.670
Carol had always been a bit eccentric, totally
harmless, of course, but what you’d describe

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.570
as being on the more “zealous” side of
religious.

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:18.650
Predictably, she wanted to ask you and your
family to come to church with her.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:22.370
Seeing as you don’t see Aunt Carol often,
you and your family decide that there’s

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:23.910
no harm in indulging her.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:28.790
You’re not an atheist family by any means,
in fact you were all raised Catholic, but

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:32.110
it felt like it’d been forever since you
last went to church.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:36.960
Aunt Carol wanted to show you and your family
the special celebrations that went on at her

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:37.960
church.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:42.309
You remember her practically grabbing you
by the wrist and dragging you to the building,

00:00:42.309 --> 00:00:44.620
her eyes filled with a crazed enthusiasm.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:50.609
That’s when you saw something incredibly
strange, there were shadows moving behind

00:00:50.609 --> 00:00:53.920
the elaborate stained glass windows.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.289
Thousands of tiny shadows, darting around.

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:59.839
And this low humming noise you faintly recognized.

00:00:59.839 --> 00:01:01.449
What was that noise?

00:01:01.449 --> 00:01:06.250
It was the cry of cicadas, but this was only
early spring.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.829
What were cicadas doing awake at this time
of year?

00:01:08.829 --> 00:01:11.610
You didn’t get much time to ponder this
question.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:16.420
In the next few seconds, you and the entire
church were surrounded by heavy duty tactical

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:17.420
vehicles.

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.600
What appeared to be a large and heavily-armed
SWAT team poured out of the vehicles.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:26.969
Unbeknownst to you, these were a Mobile Task
Force sent in by the SCP Foundation.

00:01:26.969 --> 00:01:33.829
Specifically, MTF Y-99, also known as the
Altar Boys, a specially trained group of Foundation

00:01:33.829 --> 00:01:36.300
agents used for anomalies of a religious nature.

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:42.369
You, your Aunt, and the rest of your family
are rounded up to be debriefed and given amnestics.

00:01:42.369 --> 00:01:46.570
One of the last memories they took from you
was the sight of Foundation Agents dragging

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:48.969
bloodied bodies out of the church.

00:01:48.969 --> 00:01:53.979
As the doors opened, thousands of cicadas
streamed out and dispersed into the skies.

00:01:53.979 --> 00:01:59.090
But these weren’t like any kind of cicada
you’d never seen, they were beautiful, their

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:03.140
rainbow-colored wings reminding you of ornate
stained glass.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:07.550
Who could have guessed that these pretty little
bugs are tied to an entity very likely to

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:12.030
bring about an XK-Class End of the World Scenario
some day in the future?

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:16.850
The bugs, the bodies in the church, and even
your aunt’s incredibly strange behavior

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:23.400
all fall under the umbrella of a Keter-Class
anomaly known as SCP-3004.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:28.340
But to truly understand this anomaly that
was once thought to be destroyed, and the

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:34.610
implications of it still living today, we
need to go back 600 years, to Ireland in the

00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:36.200
15th Century.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:41.280
This era was believed to be the origin of
a Gaelic religious movement known as “Cétlaidí”,

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:45.370
or the “The Singers” in English, a splinter
sect of Druidism.

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:50.160
But this was no fringe cult, The Singers were
a mainstream religion in the British Isles

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:52.460
for several hundred years.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:57.340
Its members included people of all social
classes, from lowly peasants to powerful and

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:59.030
respected figures.

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:03.480
They mingled heavily with Christians, mostly
Irish Catholics, and at some points in history

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:07.740
came close to overtaking Christianity as the
dominant religion in Ireland.

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:13.070
So, who were these people, if they’re supposedly
such a large part of recent history in the

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:14.070
area?

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:18.840
Like most Druids, their relationship with
nature was a key part of their belief system.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:24.681
In particular, they prized an extinct species
of Cicada known as Cicadetta luculenta, or

00:03:24.681 --> 00:03:27.520
the “stained glass cicada”, in English.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:31.950
The life cycle of birth and resurrection that
the cicadas underwent fascinated the Singers,

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:35.260
and they performed a number of holy rituals
around it.

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:39.710
One recorded ritual was the celebration of
children entering adulthood that was marked

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:42.290
by them first losing their baby teeth.

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:46.990
But the rituals of the Singers accidentally
opened some kind of door to a being from a

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:52.760
different plane of reality, dubbed SCP-3004-1
by the Foundation.

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:57.570
This being is an immensely powerful thought-form
that the Foundation believes to be a “Pistiphage”,

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:58.820
or “Faith Eater.”

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:04.020
It appears to have been attracted to our universe
by the rituals of the Singers, and so took

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:10.730
a form relevant to their beliefs, namely,
a huge cicada, in order to feed on their faith.

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:15.460
If things had stopped there then this would
be an almost innocent symbiotic relationship,

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:22.120
but the interactions between SCP-3004-1 and
our world led to dangerous consequences due

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:25.000
to its powerful reality-warping abilities.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:29.680
For example, during some rituals, huge numbers
of stained glass cicadas would burst from

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:34.000
the mouths of those participating, often causing
them to choke to death.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:39.390
Other times 3004-1 would manifest physically
in the sky above its new worshippers, causing

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:45.480
painful boils on whoever witnessed it, and
occasionally symptoms akin to radiation sickness.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:51.600
It appeared that 3004-1 was growing more powerful
over time, and its rise to power was intrinsically

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:56.990
linked to the rituals of the Singers and the
existence of the stained glass cicadas.

00:04:56.990 --> 00:05:01.200
Two groups that pre-dated the Foundation,
the Vatican’s “Congregation for Otherworldly

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:06.380
Acts” and the English Government’s “Royal
Society for the Imprisonment of Abnormalcy”,

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:10.310
essentially performed an all-out religious
genocide on the Singers.

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:14.460
No meaningful trace of the religion was left
when they were done, aside from their own

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:15.460
records.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:20.230
While they were at it, they also exterminated
all the stained glass cicadas, leading to

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:22.940
a complete stop of all SCP-3004 activity.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:30.150
It seemed like, despite the great human and
ecological cost, the anomaly had been neutralized.

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:35.230
A few centuries later though, a series of
strange, cicada-related anomalous events started

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.520
to occur across the United States.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:43.610
A strange man, seemingly made almost entirely
from cicada chitin, would appear at christenings,

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.350
weddings, and funerals.

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:50.490
Each time, his presence would cause the people
in attendance to do and experience horrific

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:56.080
things and lead to legacies of hardship and
death that would linger for decades.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:06:01.630
This became known as SCP-2852, or “Cousin
Johnny” and it should have been the first

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:06.240
clue that the nightmare of SCP-3004 was resurfacing.

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:11.460
But since 3004 was already archived as “neutralized”,
nobody made the connection.

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:19.639
Some time later, SCP-2852 incidents ceased,
and around that exact time, SCP-3004 instances

00:06:19.639 --> 00:06:21.110
started anew.

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:26.180
It manifested in the form of strange, anomalous
activities taking place at Christian church

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:32.740
services, specifically, those from Roman Catholic,
Eastern Catholic, Anglican, and Episcopalian

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.060
communities.

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:38.990
The only clues to outsiders would be an increase
in reported church attendance, and an increase

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:42.430
in deaths from “natural causes” within
the community.

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:47.140
These two stats were how the Foundation first
noticed something was amiss.

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:53.639
Just as it had done with the Singers centuries
before, SCP-3004-1 had latched onto the beliefs

00:06:53.639 --> 00:07:00.120
and rituals of Christians, and was using this
new connection to harvest more faith for sustenance.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.680
The results were twofold.

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:06.680
First, religious fervor and excitement to
attend church services saw a huge increase.

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:11.639
Secondly, the actual content of these services
took a hard turn for the horrific.

00:07:11.639 --> 00:07:16.050
Much like Cousin Johnny infiltrations, this
really isn’t for the faint of heart by any

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:17.050
definition.

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:22.770
For example, young people with Christ-like
stigmata wounds being bitten to death by priests.

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:27.190
Children removing the teeth of priests, before
they all start vomiting huge numbers of stained

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:28.690
glass cicadas.

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:33.480
There were extremely unpleasant rituals involving
castration and even a pregnant woman giving

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:37.460
birth to even more swarms of stained glass
cicadas.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:40.800
We could go on, but you probably get the idea.

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:47.440
Rituals inspired by SCP-3004-1 are horrific,
and all seem to involve the same extinct breed

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:52.250
of stained glass cicadas worshipped by the
Singers before their annihilation.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:58.490
But how can these insects, which have been
dubbed SCP-3004-2, be here in the present

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:02.820
if the Foundation forerunners made them extinct
so many centuries ago?

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:05.440
The answer is simple, but strange.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:09.930
While they have all the hallmarks of being
alive, the stained glass cicadas present during

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:14.370
modern iterations of SCP-3004 events aren’t
actually real.

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:19.889
Genetic tests have shown that they’re actually
made from a mix of wood and real stained glass.

00:08:19.889 --> 00:08:24.160
These insects fly away from the scene after
the rituals are completed, traveling around

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:28.220
six hundred miles from the site before disappearing
completely.

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:33.649
The Foundation was growing concerned about
the nature of SCP-3004, especially given that

00:08:33.649 --> 00:08:37.529
instances were becoming more frequent and
harder to contain.

00:08:37.529 --> 00:08:42.700
Foundation scientists determined that the
creature known as 3004-1 likely existed within

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:48.300
a layer of reality just above our own, and
if it ever managed to breach our reality,

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:52.630
the worldwide level of violence and chaos
it could cause would likely lead to an XK-Class

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:54.779
End of the World Scenario.

00:08:54.779 --> 00:08:59.279
Drastic actions would once again be needed
to prevent this, so they devised an emergency

00:08:59.279 --> 00:09:03.399
containment procedure that would only be used
as a last resort.

00:09:03.399 --> 00:09:08.730
The procedure, known as Protocol Damnatio
ad Bestias, would use a mixture of mass amnestic

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:14.230
treatment and Thaumiel objects to completely
erase Christianity from not only the modern

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:20.399
world, but all of history in the hopes of
cutting off 3004-1’s food supply to kill

00:09:20.399 --> 00:09:24.639
the entity or at least prevent it from entering
our world.

00:09:24.639 --> 00:09:28.980
The plan would center on placing a powerful
Roman-Catholic reality warper, who volunteered

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:34.220
for the job of course, into an anomalous group
of machines known as “The Lions.”

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:39.319
By submitting the reality warper to a lifetime
of suffering and essentially erasing him from

00:09:39.319 --> 00:09:44.569
existence, so too will it erase the world’s
full knowledge of Christianity, and hopefully

00:09:44.569 --> 00:09:46.209
save the world.

00:09:46.209 --> 00:09:50.550
This man will become the last martyr, dying
for all of humanity.

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:55.829
He will become the last saint, St. Jude the
Damned, Bulwark Against Darkness

00:09:55.829 --> 00:09:58.369
You might ask: Are you sure this is necessary?

00:09:58.369 --> 00:10:00.420
There’s so much we don’t know about 3004-1.

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:03.819
Do we know for a fact it’s this dangerous?

00:10:03.819 --> 00:10:09.220
Enter Agent Timothy Luttermann, a member of
Mobile Task Force Sigma-25, also known as

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:10.860
“Ghostbusters.”

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:15.889
Luttermann was part of a Foundation project
known as SIGHTSEE-LUX, using an astral projection

00:10:15.889 --> 00:10:20.540
technology that would free his consciousness
from his body, and allow it to travel freely

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:22.720
between metaphysical planes.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:27.819
In plain English, they could use Luttermann’s
floating mind as a kind of spy, and insert

00:10:27.819 --> 00:10:30.769
it into 3004-1’s dimension.

00:10:30.769 --> 00:10:36.050
They achieved this by capturing one of 3004-1’s
false stained glass cicadas, and releasing

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:40.300
it again, allowing Luttermann’s mind to
follow it home to its master.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:45.600
However, what was thought to be a simple intel
gathering mission turned into a complete nightmare.

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:51.509
Luttermann found that 3004-1’s dimension
was entirely void, aside from the entity itself,

00:10:51.509 --> 00:10:55.079
and the millions of buzzing stained glass
cicadas.

00:10:55.079 --> 00:10:59.559
The entity was so huge and so complex that
it physically hurt to look at.

00:10:59.559 --> 00:11:04.839
Luttermann observed that its form kept shifting,
from a giant cicada, to an old man, to a cicada

00:11:04.839 --> 00:11:09.990
nailed to a wooden cross, to an infinite mess
of wood and stained glass.

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:15.269
But even more terrifying than its physical
appearance were the contents of its mind.

00:11:15.269 --> 00:11:21.160
3004-1 forced itself into Agent Luttermann’s
brain, and in that moment, he finally understood

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.160
it.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:27.810
The entity, which had no concept of metaphors,
allegory, or the divide between fact and fiction,

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:32.569
truly believed that it was the Abrahamic God
depicted in the bible, and that all Christians

00:11:32.569 --> 00:11:34.360
are lovingly worshipping it.

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:39.639
In its rituals, it was imposing some of the
bloodiest parts of the bible onto its flock,

00:11:39.639 --> 00:11:41.369
believing that’s what they wanted.

00:11:41.369 --> 00:11:46.180
All the while, it fed on their faith, growing
bigger and more powerful.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:50.279
Luttermann found that just being there with
the creature was hurting his soul.

00:11:50.279 --> 00:11:55.350
If it wasn’t a God yet, he believed it had
the power to become one in time and he advised

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:58.920
that the Foundation shouldn’t send anyone
else to its dimension.

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:01.649
It was too great a risk to all life on Earth.

00:12:01.649 --> 00:12:07.980
Perhaps, to prevent the horrible fate of us
all being destroyed by 3004-1, erasing Christianity

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:10.199
would be a worthy sacrifice.

00:12:10.199 --> 00:12:12.350
That is, if it actually works.

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:17.319
After all, they thought destroying the Singers
would neutralize 3004 once and for all, and

00:12:17.319 --> 00:12:19.499
yet here it is again.

00:12:19.499 --> 00:12:23.920
For all we know, we may just be prolonging
the inevitable...

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:30.209
Now go check out “SCP - 001 - The Children
- Ouroborous Cycle” and “SCP - 5000 - Why?

00:12:30.209 --> 00:12:34.910
The Full Compilation” for more freaky anomalies
with world-shattering implications!

